{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46814","headline":"寄怀东林寺匡白监寺 · 齐己","name":"寄怀东林寺匡白监寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南岳别来无约後，东林归住有前缘。\n闲搜好句题红叶，静敛霜眉对白莲。\n雁塔影分疎桧月，虎溪声合几峯泉。\n修心若似伊耶舍，传记须添十九贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}